**Guard-quality defects measured at the pin (NOT extraction residuals; t6 §6 C9 / R7.15).** A
guard-side sweep (review §8.6) plus t5's addendum found two retained guards that exit **0** while
verifying **nothing**: **Guard-1** `scripts/verify-rows-parity.mjs` — with a byte-copy whose patch has
no `- insert:` block and an installer that prints nothing, it prints `ok: 0 row ids match the bundle
patch insert list ()` and exits **0** (the count is printed but never asserted); **Guard-2**
`scripts/verify-vendor.mjs` — with `assets` emptied 7 → 0 it prints `commit OK / version OK / stats OK
