recorded reason · **[KEEP]** = keep-with-record (declared exemption, never a silent omission).
Bucket labels are the acceptance contract's (B1 FULL-STRIP · B2 BRIDGE-BY-DESIGN · B3 SILICON-CONTENT
· B4 UNTRACKED-BUILD-ARTIFACT).

### 4.1 High

| # | Path | Bucket | Evidence path | User-visible consequence | Disposition |
